flowchart TD
  A[Normalized documents] --> B[Preprocess: clean, language, dedupe]
  B --> C[Sentence Transformer embeddings]
  C --> D[UMAP -> HDBSCAN -> c-TF-IDF = BERTopic]
  D --> E[Weekly topic volumes]
  E --> G[Growth]
  E --> M[Momentum]
  D --> N[Novelty vs previous topics]
  D --> En[Engagement]
  D --> S[Search interest]
  D --> X[Cross-source]
  G & M & N & En & S & X --> T[Trend Score 0-100, renormalised over available signals]
  E --> L[Lifecycle]
  T --> P[(Append trend_observations)]
  L --> P
